# Accounts
●	jterrazz-macbook-pro	Mac
○	github				not logged in	station settings apply github-login
○	npm				not logged in	npm login
○	claude				not logged in	claude /login
○	tailscale				not installed
○	git				no user.name nor user.email	git config --global user.name <name>
	no VMs: accounts shared with a VM appear here
